Name Rio Note - Institute #2 Horde Beacon

Interactability_Text_Line_0 I know I'm not really supposed to write this down, but I simply can't help myself. Anyway, Niterói.
Interactability_Text_Line_1 Niterói and its surrounding region was suddenly overrun a couple of months ago; nobody expected the hordes to suddenly come with a vengeance straight towards the city, nor the abnormally strong turned that led them.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 It was weird - suddenly the turned were overruning defensive outposts left and right and heading straight for Niterói, any towns in the way simply becoming collateral damage in their wake.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 My team and I were sent to Niterói after... curious interviews of refugees reported strange occurrences in the region shortly before the emergency began.
Interactability_Text_Line_4 We were only sent to collect data, maybe some biological samples, yet we found something way more interesting: a strange machine in the museum.
Interactability_Text_Line_5 Due to resource constraints, we couldn't take the entire thing with us. We did, however, collect samples from it, took some photos, and extracted footage from the on-site cameras.
Interactability_Text_Line_6 Now Caio has made everyone involved in the effort sign NDAs.